OL,3,GNEWSAHow drinking and drugs closed
OL,4,A#150k seating area
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #150,000 seating area has been ripped
OL,7,Fout just 16 months after opening due to
OL,8,Fdue to anti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FIt had been hoped that a covered
OL,11,Fseating area at Dudley Market would
OL,12,Fbring food trucks into the area and
OL,13,Fcreate a social hub to bring people
OL,14,Finto the town.
OL,16,FHowever, the food trucks and pop-ups
OL,17,Fnever materialised, and the seating
OL,18,Farea became a magnet - traders say -
OL,19,Ffor drinking, drug taking and other
OL,20,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
