OL,3,GNEWSAHow drinking and drugs closed
OL,4,A#150k seating area
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, the seating area was ripped
OL,7,Fout by Dudley Council. The local
OL,8,Fauthority has been contacted for
OL,9,Fcomment.
